  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><span class=\"noexcerpt\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin-top:0.2em; margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><div style=\"margin-left:1.6em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This article is about an outpost. This name is also used for a <a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon%27s_Gate\" title=\"Abaddon&#39;s Gate\">mission</a>&#32;and&#32;a <a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon%27s_Gate_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"Abaddon&#39;s Gate (Zaishen quest)\">Zaishen mission quest</a>.</i></div></div></span>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Abaddon's Gate\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Abaddon%27s_Gate.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Abaddon&#39;s Gate.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/bc/Abaddon%27s_Gate.jpg/196px-Abaddon%27s_Gate.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"/images/b/bc/Abaddon%27s_Gate.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Realm of Torment</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">Mission outpost</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Depths_of_Madness\" title=\"Depths of Madness\">Depths of Madness</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Heart_of_Abaddon\" title=\"Heart of Abaddon\">Heart of Abaddon</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Abaddon%27s_Gate_outpost_mission_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Abaddon&#39;s Gate outpost mission map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/0/01/Abaddon%27s_Gate_outpost_mission_map.jpg/196px-Abaddon%27s_Gate_outpost_mission_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"180\" srcset=\"/images/0/01/Abaddon%27s_Gate_outpost_mission_map.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"238\" data-file-height=\"219\" /></a><br /><small>Mission map</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Abaddon%27s_Gate_inside.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Abaddon&#39;s Gate inside.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/fc/Abaddon%27s_Gate_inside.jpg/196px-Abaddon%27s_Gate_inside.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"157\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/fc/Abaddon%27s_Gate_inside.jpg/294px-Abaddon%27s_Gate_inside.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/fc/Abaddon%27s_Gate_inside.jpg/392px-Abaddon%27s_Gate_inside.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"800\" /></a><br /><small>A view inside</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>The unimaginable torture and loneliness to which <a href=\"/wiki/The_Five_Gods\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Five Gods\">the Five Gods</a> abandoned their dark sibling lies within Abaddon's Gate. He strains against his chains and his anguish resounds throughout the <a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Realm of Torment</a>, twisting and mutilating the minds and souls of all who venture near.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— in-game description</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>Abaddon's Gate is the entrance to third and final layer of the prison built by the five gods. Beyond this gate lies the Heart of Abaddon, where the dark god, twisted by centuries of torment, strains against his prison. It lies at the bottom of the Realm of Madness, surrounded by constantly flowing falls, which carry the entire realm's torment down upon the imprisoned god.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Gw.dat\" title=\"Gw.dat\">gw.dat</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Abaddon's Gate</a> is what locks <a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon\" title=\"Abaddon\">Abaddon</a> within his prison in the <a href=\"/wiki/Heart_of_Abaddon\" title=\"Heart of Abaddon\">Heart of Abaddon</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Exits\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Exits</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Services</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Henchmen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Henchmen</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Other_allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other allies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Abaddon%27s_Gate_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Getting there\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Complete the <a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Madness\" title=\"Gate of Madness\">Gate of Madness</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Mission\" title=\"Mission\">mission</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exits\">Exits</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Abaddon%27s_Gate_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Exits\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Heart_of_Abaddon\" title=\"Heart of Abaddon\">Heart of Abaddon</a> (northeast, by talking to <a href=\"/wiki/Keeper_Shafoss\" title=\"Keeper Shafoss\">Keeper Shafoss</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Depths_of_Madness\" title=\"Depths of Madness\">Depths of Madness</a> (southeast)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Abaddon%27s_Gate_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Abaddon%27s_Gate_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Services\">Services</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Abaddon%27s_Gate_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Services\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Ahn\" title=\"Ahn\">Ahn</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Merchant\" title=\"Merchant\">merchant</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Chest\" title=\"Xunlai Chest\">Xunlai Chest</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage\">storage</a>)</li></ul>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Henchmen\">Henchmen</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Abaddon%27s_Gate_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Henchmen\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h5>\n<dl><dd><i>(all level 20)</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Devona\" title=\"Devona\">Devona</a> (Fighter)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Aidan\" title=\"Aidan\">Aidan</a> (Archer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Kihm\" title=\"Kihm\">Kihm</a> (Healer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Mhenlo\" title=\"Mhenlo\">Mhenlo</a> (Healer)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Eve\" title=\"Eve\">Eve</a> (Blood)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Odurra\" title=\"Odurra\">Odurra</a> (Illusion)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Cynn\" title=\"Cynn\">Cynn</a> (Fire)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Herta\" title=\"Herta\">Herta</a> (Earth)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Paragon\"><img alt=\"Paragon\" src=\"/images/5/55/Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sogolon\" title=\"Sogolon\">Sogolon</a> (Motivation)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Dervish\"><img alt=\"Dervish\" src=\"/images/3/3e/Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Gehraz\" title=\"Gehraz\">Gehraz</a> (Holy)</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_allies\">Other allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Abaddon%27s_Gate_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Other allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Dunbri\" title=\"Dunbri\">Dunbri</a> (mission briefing)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Keeper_Shafoss\" title=\"Keeper Shafoss\">Keeper Shafoss</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Keeper_Sharissh\" title=\"Keeper Sharissh\">Keeper Sharissh</a> (mission access)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Abaddon%27s_Gate_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Keeper_Millzesh\" title=\"Keeper Millzesh\">Keeper Millzesh</a> was once also located in this outpost.</li>\n<li>Between the waterfalls on the western side, a view of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shattered_Guildhall\" title=\"The Shattered Guildhall\">the Shattered Guildhall</a> is visible.</li></ul>\n<hr style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; clear:both;\" />\n<table style=\"border:1px solid silver; font-size:90%; width:90%; text-align:center; clear:both;\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#BAE; font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment#Towns_and_outposts\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Towns and outposts in the Realm of Torment</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Torment\" title=\"Gate of Torment\">Gate of Torment</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Abaddon's Gate</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Anguish\" title=\"Gate of Anguish\">Gate of Anguish</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Fear\" title=\"Gate of Fear\">Gate of Fear</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Madness_(outpost)\" title=\"Gate of Madness (outpost)\">Gate of Madness</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Pain_(outpost)\" title=\"Gate of Pain (outpost)\">Gate of Pain</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Secrets\" title=\"Gate of Secrets\">Gate of Secrets</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_the_Nightfallen_Lands\" title=\"Gate of the Nightfallen Lands\">Gate of the Nightfallen Lands</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow_Nexus_(outpost)\" title=\"The Shadow Nexus (outpost)\">The Shadow Nexus</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment#Missions\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Missions</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment#Explorable_areas\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Explorable areas</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment#Landmarks\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Landmarks</a></i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009132801\nCache expiry: 3600\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.090 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 921/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8625/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1